i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kvLsx66xYKwQ7kNvwEywqhW&_nc_oc=AdpYJ2O5zbZzcV_ZW29fTc3pXuNP74NCJOwiCXSWliH_5cShcxYQYobqfAjlw0Do_Mg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPCRZIgWgZ7rQDoOlgOsjaFLvLPoP-QoltDIr8LawGEkQ&oe=6AE49723"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GqB1Ls2Ux3EQ7kNvwGn4o0B&_nc_oc=Adp3o4eQ-mMhjjVeJy-rCZHi0ETpxp0sWsHRHqqiX7magg_BN0UV4lxK49kNnalaKUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPg1q3GcFANxP4vVPSiLQeWc96Cq3JIq_Hifj1cUAxigg&oe=6AE4BB5D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wdaeaP1ZGxkQ7kNvwF0drWr&_nc_oc=AdptGQ6whXn6ITEMV74cNJH_0tfevvKqv4KmOZcD5mo-GfZz_WBLnk-_KeaYsPsz9GM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM9oTFIJDxc9dR5Qmpux6aCAA3kMUcTk44QB3Hrh_kDgg&oe=6AE4A9CA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im